              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LAYLA207"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've made this recipe but with 12 ounces of beer, tequila and water in addition to the limeade for an \"on the rocks\" margarita. It's the best!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "diskris"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty! Used Corona and added some Triple Sec. Yummmm! Just a side note: I used the margaritaville to make it and there was no enough room in the pitcher to make it a frozen drink. Cut the serving size to 1 so you can make it a frozen margarita. It will require slightly more work, but the consistency will be much better!",
            "datePublished": "2012-08-12T14:43:47.577Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cupcakes and Cutlery"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm a big fan of the beer-garita, and this recipe couldn't be easier! The can of limeade gave it the right amount of sweetness and lime flavor. I used Pacifico beer and it paired really nicely with the tequila. I love that you can make this by the pitcher so it would be great to serve at any party!",
            "datePublished": "2021-04-29T18:51:30.107Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We make this every fourth of July in a large punch bowl, no messy blender cleanup! We use Tecate Beer, it is a perfect blend. It is always a huge hit.",
            "datePublished": "2001-03-16T12:19:58.467Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
