            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have used a similar recipe for years...one difference same recipe just add 6 oz orange juice (not concentrate)it cuts the bitter taste a bit. The best!!",
            "datePublished": "2005-01-02T14:15:33.497Z"
          },
          {
