            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dale"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We had these over memorial day weekend. The beer drinkers in the gang really liked them, especially since they weren't sweet. The pina coloda drinkers didn't like them at all. We used our margarita machine to make then because it's really easy. I personally thought they could use a little more pizzaz as they seemed a little bland.",
            "datePublished": "2009-06-03T04:33:57.563Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jami Lindhe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good recipe! As suggested by another user I added orange juice to cut the sour and it worked very well. Only problem I had was that our store was out of limade so I had to use frozen margarita mix. Will definitely try again with limade as the recipe states I bet it'll be even better!",
            "datePublished": "2009-05-03T10:25:47.993Z"
          },
          {
